.TH AVR\-JOB\-WATCH 1 "" "avr 0.1.3" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-job-watch \- Watch active jobs with auto-refresh (Ctrl+C to stop).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr job watch
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Watch active jobs with auto-refresh (Ctrl+C to stop).
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by repository (org/repo or rep-xxx, repeatable). Auto-detected from git remote if omitted. (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by job name (repeatable). (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-interval\fR \fIINTEGER\fR
Refresh interval in seconds. (default: 5)
.TP
\fB\-\-ndjson\fR
Emit one JSON object per refresh (default when stdout isn't a TTY).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-job (1),
.BR avr-job-list (1),
.BR avr-job-logs (1),
.BR avr-job-metrics (1),
.BR avr-job-ssh (1),
.BR avr-job-view (1)
